yers can enjoy the following features, normally available only in the full version: Temporarily Unlocked FeaturesMap Switching & Rotation — Explore different maps and enjoy more variety!Steam Cloud Support — Keep your progress synced with Steam Cloud.Steam Nicknames — Display your Steam nickname instead of a temporary nickname.Available for One Week OnlyThese ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T23:48:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688322","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5058180-1842846814451840","game_id":"steam-5058180","kind":"update","title":"New Update (1.1) :: Real-Time Sound Occlusion Update","summary":"Hello, players! A new update for BLINDFOLD: Sound Chase is now live.This update introduces a new Real-Time Sound Occlusion System, designed to make sound feel more natural and immersive during gameplay. Previously, sounds could be heard at a similar volume even when walls or other obstacles were between players. With the new system, the game now checks the physical environment between the sound source and each listener.Sounds will now become progressively more muffled depending on how many obsta","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T23:49:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451840","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5058180-1841579228671606","game_id":"steam-5058180","kind":"announcement","title":"BLINDFOLD: Sound Chase – Official Release Date Announced!","summary":"Hello, this is BLINDFOLD: Sound Chase.We’re excited to announce that BLINDFOLD: Sound Chase will officially launch the day after Steam Next Fest ends!Thank you to everyone who has shown interest in the game and played the demo during Steam Next Fest.The full version will be available for $5.99 USD, with a 15% launch discount for the first 7 days after release.We hope you enjoy the full release of BLINDFOLD: Sound Chase.Thank you for your support, and see you at launch!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T15:13:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671606","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5058180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:14Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:14Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5058180":"2026-10-26T07:39:14Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5058180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:14Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:14Z"},"5087160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:14Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:14Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5058180","app_id":5058180,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:22Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"944b02b9598d8e627df95ea72248209d4213601e9cbf8b8a978240271d147300","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"《BLINDFOLD: Sound Chase》은 눈을 가린 술래 한 명과 여러 명의 도망자가 대결을 펼치는 비대칭 온라인 술래잡기 게임입니다.\r\n보이지 않는 술래, 그리고 소리를 내면 위험에 처하는 도망자. 단순한 술래잡기이 긴장감 넘치는 심리전으로 변모합니다.","publishers":[{"name":"HIGHTALE"}],"developers":[{"name":"HIGHTALE"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_so